        "Abstract": "Understanding the evolution of job requirements is becoming more important for workers, companies and public organizations to follow the fast transformation of the employment market. This article proposes a new public dataset, FIJO, containing insurance job offers, including many soft skill annotations. The dataset consists of non-annotated and annotated French job ads published by four Canadian insurance companies between 2009 and 2020."
